{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0374_1000_009rit", "source_sha256": "8d6cdd3df62c62d9972d5d7f02ac0784b0365a413373873e13a8f3c6ea0dc9cf", "ja": "ふぅ、危なかったわ……。\nあ、{$P$}。お疲れさまです。", "zh": "呼，真是好险……\n啊，{$P$}。辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0374_1001_p", "source_sha256": "1b2a50da808be18f7b09ba3f806bbc81a8cc703bdec7f0bbc49799a5eb9e88da", "ja": "あれ、律子。どうしたんだ？\n今日はオフの日だったよな。", "zh": "咦，律子。怎么了？\n今天不是休息日吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0374_1002_009rit", "source_sha256": "a0b52905172496b6c8f89bcd67c02a3223c8fd20a3faf4f0ed7aed844d404bba", "ja": "はい。実はさっきまで買い物をしていたんですけど……\n急に雨が降ってきちゃいまして。", "zh": "是的。其实我刚才一直在买东西……没想到突然下起雨来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0374_1003_p", "source_sha256": "97170a6ada327afff74c6c81cea102851d07bb25b44b117c3bad888d0fa69cfc", "ja": "なるほど、それで雨宿りに来たわけだな。", "zh": "原来如此，所以你是来避雨的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0374_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "68d00ec0a93707e860197575c583b7271ed7ee12aee6d98d4052707ca14b2e72", "ja": "そういうことです。劇場が近くて助かりました。\n雨が止むまで、しばらく居ても大丈夫ですか？", "zh": "原来如此，所以你是来避雨的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0374_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a029da6899366f31ce845289a5934cc529ef0cdc0bcaceb482ddd12f446714cf", "ja": "もちろん構わないよ。それより服とか濡れてないか？\n必要なら、タオルを持ってくるけど。", "zh": "当然可以。比起这个，你的衣服之类的没淋湿吧？\n需要的话，我去拿条毛巾过来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0374_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "537dc325b92bb04682a1e3818262fc9ecb0544bfd55d0237d91b60bfcb08fb6d", "ja": "お気遣いありがとうございます。でも、大丈夫ですよ。\nちょうど降り始めたタイミングでしたからね。", "zh": "谢谢你的关心。不过，没关系的。\n正好是刚开始下雨的时候。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0374_1007_p", "source_sha256": "5ccdf39b4284b020278d088cd29f88929e3ceffd2539499da771a94648b708a0", "ja": "そっか、それはよかった。……ってよく見たら、\nその服、前に一緒に買いに行ったやつだよな。", "zh": "这样啊，那就好。……等等，仔细一看，那身衣服是之前和你一起去买的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0374_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "6c152f21a0c2df287d4566eddd572ffa93c3e6d8636a5eaa8b687a3bfc0d1d5c", "ja": "え？　あ、はい。せっかくの買い物でしたし、\n一番気に入っているコーデでお出かけしたいなと。", "zh": "咦？啊，是的。难得一起买了东西，所以我想穿上最喜欢的搭配出门。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0374_1009_p", "source_sha256": "2affecbc7ae0f326facaf3bc29ded32e8915b49fc714af6ce893dcf529a9f182", "ja": "一番気に入ってる？　そうなのか？", "zh": "最喜欢的？是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0374_1010_009rit", "source_sha256": "85ceaa247cfdd6129b38789231113de9a9a8227aa2f56a68a49e83f78345c424", "ja": "え……変ですか？　でも、選ぶ時、さんざん\n似合ってるって言ってくれましたよね？", "zh": "诶……很奇怪吗？可是，挑选的时候，您不是还一个劲儿地说很适合我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0374_1011_009rit", "source_sha256": "5bb5c8dba919954734a8247c1e129ba749dfa1cea475ec1179113e86812ec847", "ja": "これでも{$P$}のセンスは信用\nしてますし、実際着てみていい感じだと……。", "zh": "即便这样，我还是相信{$P$}的品味，实际穿上后感觉也挺不错的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0374_1012_009rit", "source_sha256": "ae697da20766616b8799ca817b9433296cc61ba1d6d74d9de1338d6cf2486f60", "ja": "……って、なにニヤニヤしてるんですか！", "zh": "……我说，你在贼笑什么呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0374_1013_p", "source_sha256": "05f0f4f759320c7ac759e6796b0f0af143cbc3e3336e08830c87119eb3ae3f63", "ja": "ああ、ゴメン。変とかじゃなくて、嬉しくてさ。\nそこまで気に入ってくれてるとは思わなかったから。", "zh": "啊，抱歉。不是觉得奇怪，只是因为很开心。\n没想到你会这么喜欢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0374_1014_p", "source_sha256": "a318fb1e6b87eb4bf98af044b072da2b4593398c0e5509cd36e2a554e72f3691", "ja": "うん。やっぱり律子に似合ってて、すごく可愛いな。\n髪型も相まって、普段とのギャップも……。", "zh": "嗯。果然很适合律子，非常可爱呢。\n再加上发型衬托，和平时的反差也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0374_1015_009rit", "source_sha256": "8eab12b7c16d7d2e2c68ae2d0fa2e0c2783f4e6ea1e5c23b9024d1a40a3fede2", "ja": "か、感想はもう大丈夫ですっ！　試着の時に\nさんざん聞かされて、十分わかったつもりですから！", "zh": "感、感想就不用再说了！试穿的时候已经听得够多了，我觉得自己已经充分明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0374_1016_009rit", "source_sha256": "4ddeccd5f02369ac3f7d21114204b99be4a65022e81529e6e9d836ba3ebd0226", "ja": "はぁ……。本当にこの人は、\n隙あらば人のことを褒めちぎるんだから……。", "zh": "唉……这人真是的，只要一有机会就把人夸得天花乱坠……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0374_1017_p", "source_sha256": "39f0cad60f911a2c9d0df76c53e069f0d926c711e249360019f3cef7eeb5ee79", "ja": "それより律子、この後はどうするんだ？　しばらく\n止みそうにないし、車で送って行ってもいいけど……。", "zh": "比起那个，律子，接下来打算怎么办？看样子雨一时半会儿不会停，我开车送你回去也行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0374_1018_009rit", "source_sha256": "ed59c1d73edcdaea28087a221f720e41c5e436f042a66f838953bcb5ce813a96", "ja": "えっ。あ、ああ、そうですね。\nそれはありがたいですけど……いいんですか？", "zh": "诶。啊、啊，是啊。\n那真是帮大忙了……真的可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0374_1019_p", "source_sha256": "ec4cd05d9c4e37f69be363300c3a4650e241a567a8c2986f31efb38778aeca87", "ja": "もちろん。せっかく可愛く決めて来たんだ、\n濡れて帰らせるのは俺も嫌だし、ぜひ甘えてくれ。", "zh": "当然。难得你打扮得这么可爱，我也不想让你淋湿回去，尽管依赖我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0374_1020_009rit", "source_sha256": "8d92349892cec26fed4ea8ead47f3009f8e4cc74db8a87ce8d3f71afebae9ed0", "ja": "はい……って、だから褒めなくていいんですって！\nもう……嬉しくないわけじゃないから、困るわ……。", "zh": "是……所以说，不用夸我了啦！\n真是的……也不是不高兴，只是让人很为难啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
